Logan
Hawkish
Inflation is taking too long to return to the FOMC=92s 2% target. A good de=
al of the excess inflation over the past year has come from temporary facto=
rs, such as tariffs and energy price increases. But not all.
3-Jun
Williams
Dovish-leaning
Right now I=92m not that worried about dramatic, second-round effects or pe=
rsistent inflation.
